  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Method 2 is already optimal, so we are not looking for a better time complexity.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 6580,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 197,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "The issue now is readability.",
      "start_ms": 7500,
      "end_ms": 9560,
      "start_frame": 225,
      "end_frame": 287,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "The four -way cycle needs several related indices.",
      "start_ms": 10160,
      "end_ms": 13940,
      "start_frame": 305,
      "end_frame": 418,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "First, last, offset, top, right, bottom, left.",
      "start_ms": 14580,
      "end_ms": 19920,
      "start_frame": 437,
      "end_frame": 598,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "The logic is correct, but these index relationships can be easy to mix up, especially in an interview.",
      "start_ms": 20740,
      "end_ms": 27600,
      "start_frame": 622,
      "end_frame": 828,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "So instead of inventing another movement rule, let's return to the coordinate mapping.",
      "start_ms": 27600,
      "end_ms": 34080,
      "start_frame": 828,
      "end_frame": 1022,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "We already proved our final destination is C n minus 1 minus r.",
      "start_ms": 35140,
      "end_ms": 42060,
      "start_frame": 1054,
      "end_frame": 1262,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "The question is, can we reach that destination using two simpler transformations?",
      "start_ms": 42420,
      "end_ms": 50080,
      "start_frame": 1273,
      "end_frame": 1502,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start_ms": 51000,
      "end_ms": 51440,
      "start_frame": 1530,
      "end_frame": 1543,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "And that gives us Method 3.",
      "start_ms": 52340,
      "end_ms": 55400,
      "start_frame": 1570,
      "end_frame": 1662,
      "word_count": 6
    }
  ],
